# ── Generated CTU-13 training dataset ────────────────────────
# c3_ctu13_dataset.csv is ~465 MB — over GitHub's 100 MB file limit, and
# fully regenerable via: python scripts/build_ctu13_dataset.py
# (deterministic, ~5 min, reads D:\CTU-13-Dataset).
# label_mapping_report.csv is intentionally NOT ignored — it is small (93 KB)
# and serves as the auditable label-mapping record for the research writeup.
data/c3_ctu13_dataset.csv
data/c3_ctu13_c2_dataset.csv
data/_ctu13_build_stats.csv

